        {
         "id": "b_6o4zdg3t",
         "type": "text",
         "props": {
          "html": "<p>The practical bit: join at Lerwick by noon and fly home from Tórshavn; we book both legs where wanted, under the ATOL. Landings are by tender and some are wet, announced honestly at the morning brief. Freya is a ship of stairs, and this is her sternest coast. Travel insurance is a condition of booking.</p>"
         }
        }
       ]
